        "group": "d7d249b568c5b0c4",
        "format": "<div style=\"font-family:monospace;line-height:1.8\"><div>DB10.DBD0 en bruto: <b>{{msg.payload.bytes}}</b></div><div>como REAL big-endian: <b>{{msg.payload.real}}</b></div><div>si se leyera al revés (little-endian): <b>{{msg.payload.si_fuera_little_endian}}</b></div></div>",
        "x": 600,
